00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.109
Ako ito, si Jin Jr.

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:13.310
Hindi mo ba ako nakikilala?

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:15.440
Dati, magkasama kami araw-araw.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.960
Kumain kami ng minatamis na kastanyas

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.270
at sabay na umakyat ng mga puno.

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:19.880
Nang mahulog ka mula sa puno

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:21.599
at nakahiga sa kama nang ilang araw.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:22.720
At sa isa pang pagkakataon,

00:17:23.589 --> 00:17:25.550
Gusto mo kaming tumakas sa bahay,

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:27.640
sinasabing kahit gaano kalayo,

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:29.940
magkasama kaming maglalakbay.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:36.240
Ginoo,

00:17:36.880 --> 00:17:37.590
Hindi ko alam

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:38.480
paano mo natutunan ang tungkol sa

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:40.340
itong mga kwento ko noong kabataan ko.

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:42.790
Pero napakahigpit ng tatay ko.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.480
Lumaki akong mag-isa sa aming tahanan

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:47.710
at hindi kailanman nag-aral sa anumang pribadong paaralan.

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:48.770
Wala akong mga kalaro,

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:51.240
